Z||000008||MinnGreenGT||08-02-2001||09:28 AM||||Haze...<P>I like your wood inserts... are they stick-on or do they completely replace the original panels?  I searched earlier for dash stuff and ran across the place you got them from... I'm looking forward to doing something similiar!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/strut1.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>________________________<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngt.jpg"> <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!||||reg||1
Z||000009||chester||08-02-2001||09:35 AM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero1_14.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero2_16.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero3_4.jpg">  <BR>Here are the specifics on my car;<BR>Suspension:<P>Coilovers front and rear with carrera shocks<BR>and 300# springs all in chrome.<BR>All tube control arms from RCC front and rear<BR>RCC anti bumpsteer kit<BR>All poly bushings.<BR>1" sway bar front 7/8" swaybar rear.<P>Brakes:<P>11" vented disk with GM intermediate calipers<BR>SS braided brake lines<BR>92 Blazer master cylinder<BR>(yes, the emergency brake works!)<P>Engine:<P>2.8 punched .030<BR>TRW forged pistons<BR>cloydes true double roller timing chain<BR>2030 crane cam<BR>crane lifters and pushrods<BR>1:1.6 comp cams roller tip rockers<BR>SS valves<BR>mild port/polish on heads <BR>heads shaved .020<BR>Accell 19# injectors<BR>Adjustable fuel pressure regulator with guage<BR>Hi volume oil pump<BR>windage tray<BR>ARP hardware throughout<BR>custom tube headers by Steve Hamm<BR>2 1/4 exhaust coupled to a modified flowmaster 40 series (yet to be installed)<BR>MSD 6AL ignition<BR>poly motor and cradle mounts<BR>Magnacore 10MM wires<BR>Accel electronic coil.<BR>Cold air induction from Fiero Shop in canada<P>Interior:<P>Alpine 855 head unit<BR>Kicker plate with 8" sub behind passenger seat.<BR>Chrome roll bar.<BR>Custom 3rd brake light<BR>Autometer air/fuel mixture guage and shift light.<BR>Grey marble dash kit.<P>Upgrades in the works:<P>Haltec programmable ECM<BR>Garret T3 turbo<BR>Grey leather seatcovers<BR>Digital dash setup.<P>WHEW! I think that about covers it!<BR><p>[This message has been edited by chester (edited 08-02-2001).]||||reg||1
