Z||000018||sqoach||08-02-2001||11:53 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B>Am I going to be the only one to extend the olive branch? Come on guys..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well damn Haze. You took up the whole page with pics!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>There's a pic of mine in my sig. The other three gotta go so I can put some money into this one.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <P>84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR>86 SC (FOR SALE)<BR>86 SE V6 (new project)||||reg||1
